        "TileImage": "$($repository 651ceb9a-117f-4f8d-89dd-9b6bd2a38b5a).Image",
        "Description": "47, the clock is ticking so.. i give you a quick résumé.\rDon Archibald Yates is on the urge to becoming the next Constant, we can&apos;t let this happen so you know what to do. You also need to eliminate the head of the security here in Mendoza, Tamara Vidal stay focus she has eyes everywhere and you need to also kill three Providence&apos;s Heralds, W. Yinyuan who was keeping eyes on you in Hong Kong, R. Jones who was close to Ms. Savalas and G. Quill who was in contact with the Carlisle.\rGood luck, 47",
